sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>FavouriteButton
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>AddFavouriteBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>AddFavouriteController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: save an IDP to my favourites
  UI->>B: POST /api/customer/favourites/{projectId} (JWT)
  B->>C: add(Integer customerId, Integer projectId)
  alt IDP not visible
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: findVisibleById()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C->>Favourite: add()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result
  end